  },
  "validation": "Three paired target builds and coherent tiling and construction client builds pass; 61 target declaration reports and 29,730 global simp entries match. Independent review and 18-declaration TilingWord client probes are included.",
  "limitations": [
    "The target median user CPU increased from 29.71 to 31.10 seconds in three local paired runs; this is a small incremental sample, not a general benchmark or speedup claim.",
    "TilingWord object bytes differ, although its 18 checked declaration type/axiom reports match; Assembly and CurrentConstruction objects match.",
    "Earlier client attempts used a pre-adoption provider and are excluded from current-source endpoint claims. The first simplifier attempt failed; exploratory tests are not passing evidence.",
    "Upstream project, Foundation and package dependencies remain cached; not every downstream client or environment extension was checked. Compiled objects and replay environment are excluded."
  ],
